25
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:41,639
We will visit Shenzhen to learn about China not just as a consumer market, but also as

26
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:47,919
a place to connect, build relationship and get access to knowledge and know how that

27
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:53,879
could enable New Zealand companies to grow and get access to knowledge and knowledge

28
00:02:53,879 --> 00:02:56,199
that is not available here in New Zealand.

29
00:02:56,199 --> 00:03:02,000
So we hope that we can be inspired and learn from Shenzhen's success over the last decades.

30
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:09,799
Why specifically Shenzhen though, not other Chinese cities, not Beijing, not Shanghai,

31
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:15,160
