32
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:20,439
What is exciting is that Shenzhen has really become one of the leading hubs for new technologies

33
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:26,000
and for innovation and we believe it's a very dynamic and entrepreneurial city.

34
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,500
All right.

35
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:33,320
Mr. Jill, let me go to you then because Shenzhen for many people it's very familiar, but for

36
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:37,520
