37
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:41,439
It is in southern China in the province of Guangdong or Canton.

38
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:44,800
It is one hour drive away from Hong Kong.

39
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:49,800
It is a very young city, you know, the average age is 30 something.

40
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:52,160
It's two and a half the size of New York City.

41
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:56,000
Its population is 18 million, 10 times that of Silicon Valley.

42
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:02,000
But tell us more about the city, exactly why the city is buzzing at this moment.

43
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:07,480
Well, as you mentioned about that innovation and the young people, I think that about 20

44
00:04:07,479 --> 00:04:12,639
years ago I went to Shenzhen and I always noticed that so many young people there and

45
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:18,839
working on the street, I think that they are having many energy to try to create their own businesses.

46
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:23,680
So I think this time we choose Shenzhen to be one of the most important, you know, the

47
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:29,519
