48
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:35,759
Shenzhen is one of our super large cities you mentioned about the population and also a lot of enterprises.

49
00:04:35,759 --> 00:04:41,480
I mean, that is not just coming from the government action, it's really coming from the market.

50
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:45,439
People are gathering there, they have more abilities to deal with the new technology.

51
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:50,240
I think that is what they are very attractive and they have the neighbor of Hong Kong.

52
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:56,139
So that position or location has made it a real attractive place for the incoming capitals

53
00:04:56,139 --> 00:05:01,159
