56
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:20,960
What has that done to you as a French business person and, you know, someone who studies China?

57
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,760
What has that done to you?

58
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:25,160
It is a wonderful place.

59
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:28,760
It is a wonderful mega city in a mega region.

60
00:05:28,759 --> 00:05:30,259
It is very exciting to be here.

61
00:05:30,039 --> 00:05:35,199
It is very fascinating because Shenzhen is a city full of technological innovation.

62
00:05:35,199 --> 00:05:42,639
It is a real hub connecting the dots in Asia Pacific and it is a city, also a young city

63
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:50,159
