65
00:05:52,720 --> 00:06:00,840
So and yeah, full of new kind of engineers for this new innovation hub and it is great.

66
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:04,080
It is very, very exciting to be here.

67
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:11,920
APEC, you know, for many people, APEC, although it has been around as a non-profit forum for

68
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:19,800
