69
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:23,360
Professor Fiedler, let me go to you.

70
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,960
How important is APEC as a platform?

71
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:32,120
Why does it matter that we gather the economies of the Asia Pacific region to come and meet

72
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:37,120
and talk about policies and, you know, potentially coordinate their policies?

73
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:44,040
For places like New Zealand, it is incredibly important for our well-being at economic growth.

74
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:48,800
As you know, New Zealand, we are very far from other major markets and we have the rule

75
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:56,079
