76
00:06:56,079 --> 00:07:02,840
So for us, APEC is one of the key cornerstones for our growth strategy.

77
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:06,519
Mr. Joe, again, more details about APEC.

78
00:07:06,519 --> 00:07:12,400
For instance, there are 21 economies around the Asia Pacific region, China, the United

79
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:18,480
States, Russia, Japan, the Republic of Korea, Australia, New Zealand and Canada, for instance,

80
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:24,720
