88
00:08:05,019 --> 00:08:07,399
So we have the first demonstration in Tianjin.

89
00:08:07,399 --> 00:08:08,899
I think that is one example.

90
00:08:08,879 --> 00:08:11,399
We can share the world with what we are having.

91
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:16,079
Well, this time we chose Xinjiang because Xinjiang is really our different city compared

92
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:21,679
with traditional cities like Beijing, Shanghai and Tianjin because Xinjiang is aiming for

93
00:08:21,679 --> 00:08:27,000
the future industries for some of the technology for the innovation-based development.

94
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:31,479
So I think this time we are really giving the world some possible understanding about

95
00:08:31,479 --> 00:08:38,799
