98
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:53,439
So I think that's some of the reasons we are choosing Xinjiang as a city for this APEC summit.

99
00:08:53,439 --> 00:09:01,120
Fabian, what is your opinion as the choice of the city of Xinjiang for the world economy

100
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:03,279
