101
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:09,159
Is China trying to tell or send a message to the world that this is where the future

102
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:16,480
is, this is where we need to pull our resources, pull our intelligence and try to work together?

103
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:18,480
What is your take?

104
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,279
Yes, absolutely.

105
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:24,159
Xinjiang is now a great example.

106
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:28,199
It's now a new model, a modernization of innovation.

107
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:36,280
But this APEC forum is based about considering digital and green technologies.

108
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:45,280
And also Xinjiang is a great example of systemic orchestration with green environment and efficiency

109
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,879
