110
00:09:46,879 --> 00:09:55,759
So when we see in Xinjiang all those successful technology breakthrough innovation pattern,

111
00:09:55,759 --> 00:10:02,200
all those strategic innovation clusters, when we can see also those industrial ecosystem,

112
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:08,240
Xinjiang is definitely the right model and the right example to inspire the world.

113
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:13,120
How do you explain the 30% jump of visitors to Xinjiang since the beginning of this year,

114
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:17,120
