117
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,679
What is your understanding of what's going on here?

118
00:10:32,679 --> 00:10:35,759
Because 30% is a big number, right?

119
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:41,559
And where do you think primarily these people coming from?

120
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:43,559
I think yes, definitely.

121
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:50,600
Nowadays, Xinjiang has a great soft power, I would say, because we can see online on

122
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:59,040
