125
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:11,240
So people are very excited to see that, yes, definitely.

126
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:16,639
Professor Fiedler, what are the questions you are looking for answers for?

127
00:11:16,639 --> 00:11:25,120
And also from the New Zealand point of view, what potentially can be the opportunities

128
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:33,319
