130
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:41,319
I believe New Zealand and China, we share a lot of values.

131
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:47,280
We both have a very strong commitment to sustainability, and we have complementary resources.

132
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:53,200
So in New Zealand, we have a lot of ideas and inspiration for entrepreneurship, but what

133
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:57,720
