191
00:16:25,159 --> 00:16:27,480
Fabienne, what is your understanding?

192
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:35,600
Why in such extraordinary terms, this spot, this city against the backdrop of that Greater

193
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:45,040
