196
00:17:01,959 --> 00:17:09,119
It's what now we are trying to reach something like the globalization 2.0.

197
00:17:09,199 --> 00:17:18,839
I think Shenzhen is a perfect hub, is a perfect place to have a multidisciplinary, transdiscipline,

198
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:27,079
