199
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:28,579
different tech dynamism.

200
00:17:28,559 --> 00:17:35,079
Yes, I think it's a great place for people to share, to dialogue, for research institutions.

201
00:17:35,079 --> 00:17:40,000
Take an example.

202
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:47,439
You see, we have in Shenzhen a lot of strategic innovation clusters between universities and

203
00:17:47,439 --> 00:17:54,599
